{"product_id":"design-of-structural-steelwork","title":"Design of Structural Steelwork","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis text aims to develop an understanding of Limit State Design as applied to structural steelwork. The use of the relevant codes of practice, in particular BS 5950: Part 1, is explained and demonstrated in numerous worked examples and illustrations. The treatment is both extensive and comprehensive, including a selection of design examples which are presented in a format typical of that used in a design office in order to encourage students to adopt a methodical and rational approach in preparing structural calculations.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 189 x 246\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: W.M.C. McKenzie\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780333715796\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803714773145,"sku":"ACA-29780333715796","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f3be903f97a_9780333715796.jpg?v=1760806310","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/design-of-structural-steelwork","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}